{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33927","headline":"江南道中怀茅山广文南阳博士三首 三 · 皮日休","name":"江南道中怀茅山广文南阳博士三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五色香烟惹内文，石饴初熟酒初醺。\n将开丹竈那防鹤，欲算棋图却望云。\n海气平生当洞见，瀑冰初坼隔山闻。\n如何世外无交者，一卧金坛只有君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}